WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.960
DARCY LEWIS: Oh my god.

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:02.310
This is going on Facebook. 
Smile.

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:05.754
[MISCHIEVOUS MUSIC]

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:12.070
Look at you.

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:14.320
Still all muscly and everything.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:15.830
How's space?

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:16.630
 Space is fine.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:22.720
DARCY LEWIS: Whoa.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:23.620
Does he need CPR?

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:24.775
Because I totally know CPR.

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:32.820
Is there somewhere a lady
could get a cup of coffee?

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:34.170
You guys look like
you might get down

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:36.240
with those little pod things.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.180
Horrendous for the environment.

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:45.120
 So I show up to work at the
lab, slash your mom's house,

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:48.840
fully expecting you to be
moping around in your pajamas,

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.580
eating ice cream,
and obsessing about

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:52.182
[CLEARS THROAT] you know who.

00:00:52.182 --> 00:00:53.910
But you're not.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:55.290
You're wearing lady clothes.

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:56.380
You even showered, didn't you?

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:57.180
You smell good.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:01.927
 I'll tell you everything
you wish to know.

00:01:01.927 --> 00:01:02.727
 Everything?

00:01:02.727 --> 00:01:03.580
 Yes.

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:06.090
All the answers you seek will
be yours once I reclaim Mjolnir.

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:07.540
 Meow-meow?

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:08.740
What's Meow-meow?

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:14.140
 Ms. Lewis.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:15.990
 Dr. Lewis.

